                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Greedy suppressor blind spot:</strong> greedy JCCS deflation misses
                  components whose removal improves task score (two NIAH suppressors emerged by
                  joint ablation).
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Dense variable tracking:</strong> resists sparsification across K ∈ [6, 64]
